{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_196_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，王正月，吳子夷末卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_196_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"二、二月，癸酉，有事於武宮，籥入，叔弓卒，去樂，卒事。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_196_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"君在祭樂之中，聞大夫之喪，則去樂卒事，禮也。君在祭樂之中，大夫有變，以聞，可乎？大夫，國體也。古之人重死，君命無所不通。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_196_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"三、夏，蔡朝吳出奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_196_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"四、六月，丁巳，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_196_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"五、秋，晉荀吳帥師伐鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_196_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_196","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}